workflows/*.api.json
  Generated by scripts/build-workflows.ts from the official ComfyUI workflow
  templates in the `comfyui-workflow-templates` package (Comfy-Org), version
  0.11.76, License: MIT. Templates used: video_ltx2_5_i2v, video_ltx2_5_t2v,
  image_z_image_turbo, utility_seedvr2_3b_int8_upscale_video,
  utility_birefnet_remove_background, image_qwen_image_edit_2511_int8,
  utility_seedvr2_3b_int8_upscale_image, utility_video_segment_sam3,
  video_wan_vace_outpainting, utility_video_frame_interpolation,
  video_minimax_h3_i2v, video_wan2_2_14B_flf2v, video_ltx2_5_flf2v,
  llm_qwen3vl_text_gen. Changes:
  converted to the API format; output filename prefixes set; in the BiRefNet
  graph, the preview node is replaced by a save node; in the two SAM 3 graphs,
  the per-frame detection and its preview are replaced by the core tracking
  nodes (SAM3_VideoTrack, SAM3_TrackToMask) and a save node; in the two Wan
  VACE graphs, the clip is cut to one run, scaled and cropped before the
  padding, the previews are removed, and the CausVid LoRA (CC BY-NC 4.0) is
  replaced by lightx2v's Apache-2.0 LoRA (14B) or removed (1.3B, template
  defaults); in the frame-interpolation graphs, the template's FrameInterpolate
  is kept (FILM) or replaced by RIFE VFI; in the H3 graph, a second image is
  wired to the node's last_frame and the turbo-LoRA branch (off in the
  template) is removed; in the LTX-2.5 extend graph (from the first + last
  frame template), the first-frame image becomes a short clip of the source's
  last frames (LoadVideo, GetVideoComponents, ImageFromBatch) guiding at frame
  0 with strength 1, the last-frame guide is removed, and the guide is resized
  by stretching (lanczos) instead of a centre crop; in the Qwen3-VL text graph,
  the single image becomes a few frames of a clip (LoadVideo,
  GetVideoComponents) and the answer is capped at 320 tokens; the H3 draft graph
  (h3-flf-draft) keeps the template's turbo-LoRA branch, switched on, with the
  4-step LoRA its note names and 4 steps.

workflows/ltx25-refine, -restore, -deblur, -decompression, -colorize,
-cleanplate, -alpha, -daynight, -sdr2hdr (*.json, *.api.json)
  Written by scripts/build-finishing.ts from core/finishing: a representative
  run of each LTX finishing tool (at run time the engine builds each graph from
  the clip in hand). The node chains follow the official example workflows of
  ComfyUI-LTXVideo 1.1.0 (Lightricks), example_workflows/2.5; no file of those
  workflows is included.

scripts/fixtures/ltx-tiling.json
  Answers of ComfyUI-LTXVideo's LTXVGetTilingSizes node, recorded on the
  author's install for the offline checks.

